   ("What signs of hail can I see from the ground?", "Dents on vents, metal edges and outdoor equipment, and piles of granules at downspouts."),
   ("Does hail affect metal roofs?", "It can dent them. Some dents are only cosmetic; a roofer can tell you."),
   ("Can I go on the roof to look?", "No. Let a roofer check it safely."),
   ("Does hail affect tile roofs?", "It can crack tiles, especially older ones."),
